Spec-First is a concept.
Spec-Anchored is a concept.
Spec-As-Source is a concept.
Spec-Driven-Development includes Spec-First.
Spec-Driven-Development includes Spec-Anchored.
Spec-Driven-Development includes Spec-As-Source.
Tessl explores Spec-As-Source.
Spec-As-Source relates-to Model-Driven-Development.
Model-Driven-Development is a concept.

